{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "events": [
    {
      "id":"EVT_NAMELESS_CITY_001","version":1,"title":"祖山现世",
      "body":"妖界百族在同一夜梦见一座燃烧的黑山。第八日清晨，传说中早已崩毁的万兽祖山竟横在三宗商路中央。山门无人看守，石壁上的古老兽纹却与你的本源血脉一模一样，仿佛这座山已经等了你千年。",
      "tags":["realm:integration","monster","story_chain","nameless_city","probability_gate"],"weight":0,"repeat":"once",
      "trigger":{"milestone":"nameless_city_eligible","base_chance":0.14,"unit_increment":0.02},
      "conditions":{"all":[{"path":"player.path","op":"eq","value":"monster"},{"path":"player.realm_index","op":"eq","value":7}]},
      "choices":[
        {"id":"answer","text":"以自身血脉回应山门兽纹","effects":[{"type":"set_flag","flag":"nameless_city_answered"},{"type":"queue_event","event_id":"EVT_NAMELESS_CITY_002"}]},
        {"id":"inspect","text":"不碰兽纹，先以神识探查护山大阵","effects":[{"type":"restore_mp","value":-0.10},{"type":"set_flag","flag":"nameless_city_cautious"},{"type":"queue_event","event_id":"EVT_NAMELESS_CITY_002"}]},
        {"id":"escort","text":"先护送被妖梦引来的低阶族群入山","effects":[{"type":"add_karma","value":-4},{"type":"set_flag","flag":"nameless_people_first"},{"type":"queue_event","event_id":"EVT_NAMELESS_CITY_002"}]},
        {"id":"leave","text":"祖山来历不明，绕路离开","effects":[{"type":"set_flag","flag":"nameless_city_refused"}]}
      ]
    },
    {
      "id":"EVT_NAMELESS_CITY_002","version":1,"title":"八脉祖壁",
      "body":"山腹立着八面祖壁，每一面都记载着一个本源族群如何从蛮荒中开智。奇怪的是，八幅壁画都把自己画成万妖始祖，其余七族只是后来分出的旁支。壁画末端又都缺少同一块石片，显然有人故意抹去了祖山真正的来历。",
      "tags":["realm:integration","monster","story_chain","nameless_city","manual_only"],"weight":0,
      "choices":[
        {"id":"preserve","text":"拓下八面祖壁，暂不替任何一族定祖","effects":[{"type":"set_flag","flag":"nameless_preserve_truth"},{"type":"add_opportunity","value":18},{"type":"queue_event","event_id":"EVT_NAMELESS_CITY_003"}]},
        {"id":"compare","text":"召集八族后裔，共同辨认壁画真伪","effects":[{"type":"restore_mp","value":-0.14},{"type":"set_flag","flag":"nameless_listened"},{"type":"queue_event","event_id":"EVT_NAMELESS_CITY_003"}]},
        {"id":"take_page","text":"取走属于本族的残缺壁石","effects":[{"type":"add_karma","value":6},{"type":"set_flag","flag":"nameless_claimed_page"},{"type":"queue_event","event_id":"EVT_NAMELESS_CITY_003"}]}
      ]
    },
    {
      "id":"EVT_NAMELESS_CITY_003","version":1,"title":"祖火将熄",
      "body":"守山婆婆带你来到地心祖坛。祖火本该以万族自愿献出的少许精血为薪，历代山主却渐渐改成每隔百年献祭一名最强血脉者。如今祖山刚刚复苏，旧阵便选中了你；若不献祭，祖火三日后熄灭，山中所有生灵都会随祖山坠回虚空。",
      "tags":["realm:integration","monster","story_chain","nameless_city","manual_only"],"weight":0,
      "choices":[
        {"id":"stop","text":"先停下献祭古阵，哪怕祖火因此衰弱","effects":[{"type":"set_flag","flag":"nameless_people_first"},{"type":"add_karma","value":-7},{"type":"queue_event","event_id":"EVT_NAMELESS_CITY_004"}]},
        {"id":"record","text":"以自身妖力暂护祖火，为众人争取时间","effects":[{"type":"attribute_check","checks":[{"stat":"mp_ratio","op":"gte","value":0.55}],"failure_reason":"万族残血同时灌入经脉，你被祖火炼成灰烬","success_text":"你以妖力托住祖火，使它三日之内不至熄灭。"},{"type":"restore_mp","value":-0.22,"if_result":["check_success"]},{"type":"set_flag","flag":"nameless_kept_names","if_result":["check_success"]},{"type":"queue_event","event_id":"EVT_NAMELESS_CITY_004","if_result":["check_success"]}]},
        {"id":"maintain","text":"维持旧祭，以一人血脉换满山生灵","effects":[{"type":"add_karma","value":12},{"type":"set_flag","flag":"nameless_old_law"},{"type":"queue_event","event_id":"EVT_NAMELESS_CITY_004"}]}
      ]
    },
    {
      "id":"EVT_NAMELESS_CITY_004","version":1,"title":"无相妖祖",
      "body":"祖坛深处走出一名没有本相的古妖，自称万兽山主。它承认山门上的血脉印记并非天意，而是自己从八族祖壁中推演出的诱饵；它要借当世最强妖修的肉身重生。只要你自愿献出一缕本源，它便能先稳住祖山百年，再慢慢完成夺舍。",
      "tags":["realm:integration","monster","story_chain","nameless_city","manual_only"],"weight":0,
      "choices":[
        {"id":"lend","text":"暂借一缕本源，三日内另寻稳山之法","effects":[{"type":"add_fame","value":-8},{"type":"set_flag","flag":"nameless_lent_name"},{"type":"queue_event","event_id":"EVT_NAMELESS_CITY_005"}]},
        {"id":"refuse","text":"拒绝让任何族人再成为祖火祭品","effects":[{"type":"set_flag","flag":"nameless_break_old_law"},{"type":"queue_event","event_id":"EVT_NAMELESS_CITY_005"}]},
        {"id":"claim","text":"夺取万兽骨印，亲自掌控祖坛","effects":[{"type":"add_karma","value":10},{"type":"set_flag","flag":"nameless_claimed_city"},{"type":"queue_event","event_id":"EVT_NAMELESS_CITY_005"}]},
        {"id":"expose","text":"将八面祖壁投映到山外，请百族共同辨真伪","conditions":{"has_flag":"nameless_preserve_truth"},"disabled_reason":"你没有保住八面祖壁的完整拓本","effects":[{"type":"set_flag","flag":"nameless_public_record"},{"type":"queue_event","event_id":"EVT_NAMELESS_CITY_005"}]}
      ]
    },
    {
      "id":"EVT_NAMELESS_CITY_005","version":1,"title":"百族围山",
      "body":"祖壁投影传遍妖界后，百族强者齐聚山外。有人要迎回祖山，有人要毁掉夺舍古妖，还有人只想抢走万兽骨印。山中却聚集着被妖梦召来的数万低阶妖族；一旦外界强攻，他们会最先死在护山大阵与百族神通之间。",
      "tags":["realm:integration","monster","story_chain","nameless_city","manual_only"],"weight":0,
      "choices":[
        {"id":"hold","text":"独守山门一夜，不让双方先动手（战力至少 8,200,000）","effects":[{"type":"attribute_check","checks":[{"stat":"combat_power","op":"gte","value":8200000}],"failure_reason":"百族战阵击穿山门，你与失控的祖火一同埋入界隙","success_text":"你不替古妖辩解，只以一夜为限逼百族停手。"},{"type":"set_flag","flag":"nameless_held_gate","if_result":["check_success"]},{"type":"queue_event","event_id":"EVT_NAMELESS_CITY_006","if_result":["check_success"]}]},
        {"id":"negotiate","text":"公开祖壁拓本，邀请八族共同查验祖坛","conditions":{"has_flag":"nameless_public_record"},"disabled_reason":"你没有可供百族互相核验的完整拓本","effects":[{"type":"add_karma","value":-5},{"type":"set_flag","flag":"nameless_alliance"},{"type":"queue_event","event_id":"EVT_NAMELESS_CITY_006"}]},
        {"id":"open","text":"打开山门疏散低阶妖族，放弃整座祖山","effects":[{"type":"set_flag","flag":"nameless_evacuated"},{"type":"add_karma","value":-8},{"type":"queue_event","event_id":"EVT_NAMELESS_CITY_006"}]},
        {"id":"command","text":"催动万兽骨印，命护山妖灵攻击百族联军","conditions":{"has_flag":"nameless_claimed_city"},"disabled_reason":"你没有取得万兽骨印","effects":[{"type":"add_karma","value":20},{"type":"set_flag","flag":"nameless_weaponized"},{"type":"queue_event","event_id":"EVT_NAMELESS_CITY_006"}]}
      ]
