    {
      "id":"EVT_NAMELESS_CITY_006","version":1,"title":"第一缕祖火",
      "body":"守山婆婆从祖坛底取出一簇最初的火种。火中没有哪位无上妖祖，只有上古百兽为抵御天灾，各自献出一滴精血、共同点火的景象。祖火从来不需要牺牲最强者；无相妖祖篡改古阵，只因献祭得来的本源更方便它一次次夺舍重生。",
      "tags":["realm:integration","monster","story_chain","nameless_city","manual_only"],"weight":0,
      "choices":[
        {"id":"carry","text":"接过祖火，以自身血脉暂代万族火薪","effects":[{"type":"attribute_check","checks":[{"stat":"mp","op":"gte","value":210000}],"failure_reason":"万族精血冲突撕碎妖魂，你也成了祖坛中的一具枯骨","success_text":"你的血脉没有吞并百族，只替它们托住了将熄的火种。"},{"type":"restore_mp","value":-0.30,"if_result":["check_success"]},{"type":"set_flag","flag":"nameless_memory_bearer","if_result":["check_success"]},{"type":"queue_event","event_id":"EVT_NAMELESS_CITY_007","if_result":["check_success"]}]},
        {"id":"share","text":"请山中每个族群自愿献出一滴精血","effects":[{"type":"set_flag","flag":"nameless_shared_memory"},{"type":"add_opportunity","value":30},{"type":"queue_event","event_id":"EVT_NAMELESS_CITY_007"}]},
        {"id":"burn","text":"焚毁献祭古阵，以最后火种强行重启祖坛","effects":[{"type":"damage","value":0.20,"reason":"献祭古阵反噬焚尽元神"},{"type":"set_flag","flag":"nameless_burned_ledger","if_result":["injured"]},{"type":"queue_event","event_id":"EVT_NAMELESS_CITY_007","if_result":["injured"]}]}
